{"_id":"9ea02b039a4388a1","name":"Halberd","type":"weapon","img":"systems/last-arc-analogue/assets/ffxiv-icons/WAR/Heavy_Swing.webp","system":{"category":"Polearms","description":"A versatile polearm, bearing both axe and spear at its head. Should your attack roll beat both a target’s Ref and Fort Defence, the Unseat technick may be applied to the attack, even though it is not a counterattack. This weapon grants you reach 2. This weapon requires 17 Str to be wielded 1-handed by medium creatures and may not be wielded by small creatures.","cost":23500,"availability":"Rare","bulk":2,"weaponGroup":"polearms","weaponSize":"Large","weaponSkill":"two-handed","attack":{"bonus":4},"damage":{"formula":"2d10+4","type":"Piercing or Slashing"},"range":"Melee","capacity":0,"specialRules":"A versatile polearm, bearing both axe and spear at its head. Should your attack roll beat both a target’s Ref and Fort Defence, the Unseat technick may be applied to the attack, even though it is not a counterattack. This weapon grants you reach 2. This weapon requires 17 Str to be wielded 1-handed by medium creatures and may not be wielded by small creatures.","prerequisites":{"str":17}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{}}
